OL,3,GNEWSA'New era' for rare piano in museum
OL,4,Arevamp move
OL,5,
OL,6,FA century-old piano is set to move to a
OL,7,Fnew home as the museum where it is
OL,8,Fplaced closes for refurbishment.
OL,10,FSunderland Pianoforte Society has kept
OL,11,Fthe Model D Steinway at the city's
OL,12,FMuseum and Winter Gardens for decades,
OL,13,Fbut the venue is closing its doors to
OL,14,Fvisitors later ahead of a two
OL,15,Fyear-revamp.
OL,17,FSociety chair Eileen Bown said it was a
OL,18,F"new era" and the group hoped to grow
OL,19,Fits audience when the instrument moved
OL,20,Fto Hope Street Xchange in the city
OL,21,Fcentre in early October.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
